  '''
# ---
# name: test_help[ddflow doctor]
  '''
  usage: ddflow doctor [-h] [--upgrade]
  
  options:
    -h, --help  show this help message and exit
    --upgrade   the upgrade plan instead (the same as `ddflow upgrade`)
  
  '''
# ---
# name: test_help[ddflow dupes]
  '''
  usage: ddflow dupes [-h] [--kind KIND] [--open-only] [--floor FLOOR] [--limit LIMIT]
  
  options:
    -h, --help     show this help message and exit
    --kind KIND    comma-separated subset of [dedupe].kinds:
                   bug,task,phase,lesson,decision,research,memory (default: all of them)
    --open-only    only pairs where both records are still live (the dedupe_sweep pass)
    --floor FLOOR  minimum score to report (default: [dedupe].show_floor)
    --limit LIMIT  at most N pairs (0 = all)
  
  '''
# ---
# name: test_help[ddflow export]
  '''
  usage: ddflow export [-h] [--path PATH] [--mode MODE] [--local] [--lock] [--all] [--since SINCE] [--version VERSION] [--phase PHASE] [--item ITEM] [--status STATUS] [--tag TAG] [--session SESSION] [--limit LIMIT] [--max-bytes MAX_BYTES] [--template TEMPLATE] [--diff] [--check] [--update] [--out OUT] [--force] [--yes] [doc] [target]
  
  positional arguments:
    doc                   the document kind; omit to list the kinds. Or a verb: enable <doc>,
                          disable <doc>, ack, eject <doc>, validate [<doc>]
    target                the document, after a verb
  
  options:
    -h, --help            show this help message and exit
    --path PATH           enable: the target file (repo-relative)
    --mode MODE           enable: whole, region or append
    --local               enable/disable: this machine only
    --lock                disable: the operator's veto; agents cannot enable it
    --all                 act on the selected documents
    --since SINCE         entries at or after this date (YYYY-MM-DD or a timestamp prefix)
    --version VERSION     one release (the changelog kind: X or vX, or unreleased)
    --phase PHASE         one phase
    --item ITEM           one item (the bugs document filters it as a phase)
    --status STATUS       one status, e.g. open or fixed
    --tag TAG             one tag
    --session SESSION     one session id
    --limit LIMIT         at most N entries
    --max-bytes MAX_BYTES
                          size cap for printing (default [export].max_bytes)
    --template TEMPLATE   render once with this template file; writes nothing
    --diff                show what a write would change
    --check               exit 1 if the target is not what a write would produce
    --update              write the configured target (asks on a terminal)
    --out OUT             write to this repo-relative path instead
    --force               overwrite a hand-edited or unmarked target
    --yes                 with --update: do not ask on a terminal
  
  '''
# ---
# name: test_help[ddflow external sync]
  '''
  usage: ddflow external sync [-h]
  
  options:
    -h, --help  show this help message and exit
  
  '''
