  '''
# ---
# name: test_help[ddflow link]
  '''
  usage: ddflow link [-h] (--extends ID | --duplicate-of ID | --related ID | --distinct ID) [--reason REASON] subject
  
  positional arguments:
    subject            the record being related (the duplicate, for a merge)
  
  options:
    -h, --help         show this help message and exit
    --extends ID       subject adds to ID
    --duplicate-of ID  subject is the same thing as ID
    --related ID       subject is related to ID
    --distinct ID      subject is NOT a duplicate of ID: dismiss the pair for good
    --reason REASON    why, recorded with the link
  
  '''
