    --phase PHASE        with no --item: anything ready in this phase
    --kind {task,phase}
    --globs GLOBS        with --item: the globs you will claim with, so READY means that claim will
                         succeed; path globs, comma-separated (a.py,src/**) or a JSON array; repeat
                         the flag to add more -- every value is kept
