  options:
    -h, --help  show this help message and exit
  
  '''
# ---
# name: test_help[ddflow workflow]
  '''
  usage: ddflow workflow [-h] {state,pipeline,gate,drop} ...
  
  positional arguments:
    {state,pipeline,gate,drop}
      state               one-page overview: workflow, rules, queue, bugs, diagram
      pipeline            set the gates a task or phase passes through
      gate                define or change one gate
      drop                take a gate out of the pipelines (its definition stays)
  
  options:
